{"word": "學生", "lang_code": "zh", "lang": "漢語", "pos": "noun", "pos_title": "名詞", "senses": [{"glosses": ["在學讀書的人"], "categories": ["分類詞為「位」的漢語名詞", "有使用例的官話詞", "有引文的官話詞"], "examples": [{"text": "學生時代", "bold_text_offsets": [[0, 2]], "roman": "xuéshēng shídài", "bold_roman_offsets": [[0, 8]], "tags": ["Traditional-Chinese"]}, {"text": "学生时代", "bold_text_offsets": [[0, 2]], "roman": "xuéshēng shídài", "bold_roman_offsets": [[0, 8]], "tags": ["Simplified-Chinese"]}, {"text": "學生手冊", "bold_text_offsets": [[0, 2]], "roman": "xuéshēng shǒucè", "bold_roman_offsets": [[0, 8]], "tags": ["Traditional-Chinese"]}, {"text": "学生手册", "bold_text_offsets": [[0, 2]], "roman": "xuéshēng shǒucè", "bold_roman_offsets": [[0, 8]], "tags": ["Simplified-Chinese"]}, {"text": "一位認真的學生", "bold_text_offsets": [[5, 7]], "roman": "yī wèi rènzhēn de xuéshēng", "bold_roman_offsets": [[18, 26]], "tags": ["Traditional-Chinese"]}, {"text": "一位认真的学生", "bold_text_offsets": [[5, 7]], "roman": "yī wèi rènzhēn de xuéshēng", "bold_roman_offsets": [[18, 26]], "tags": ["Simplified-Chinese"]}, {"text": "提高學生素質", "bold_text_offsets": [[2, 4]], "roman": "tígāo xuéshēng sùzhì", "bold_roman_offsets": [[6, 14]], "tags": ["Traditional-Chinese"]}, {"text": "提高学生素质", "bold_text_offsets": [[2, 4]], "roman": "tígāo xuéshēng sùzhì", "bold_roman_offsets": [[6, 14]], "tags": ["Simplified-Chinese"]}, {"text": "誘發學生寫作興趣的方法", "bold_text_offsets": [[2, 4]], "roman": "yòufā xuéshēng xiězuò xìngqù de fāngfǎ", "bold_roman_offsets": [[6, 14]], "tags": ["Pinyin", "Standard-Chinese", "Traditional-Chinese"]}, {"text": "诱发学生写作兴趣的方法", "bold_text_offsets": [[2, 4]], "roman": "yòufā xuéshēng xiězuò xìngqù de fāngfǎ", "bold_roman_offsets": [[6, 14]], "tags": ["Pinyin", "Standard-Chinese", "Simplified-Chinese"]}, {"text": "我不是學生，我是工程師。", "bold_text_offsets": [[3, 5]], "roman": "Wǒ bù shì xuéshēng, wǒ shì gōngchéngshī.", "bold_roman_offsets": [[10, 18]], "tags": ["Pinyin", "Standard-Chinese", "Traditional-Chinese"]}, {"text": "我不是学生，我是工程师。", "bold_text_offsets": [[3, 5]], "roman": "Wǒ bù shì xuéshēng, wǒ shì gōngchéngshī.", "bold_roman_offsets": [[10, 18]], "tags": ["Pinyin", "Standard-Chinese", "Simplified-Chinese"]}, {"text": "大多數學生考完了試。", "bold_text_offsets": [[3, 5]], "roman": "Dàduōshù xuéshēng kǎo wán le shì.", "bold_roman_offsets": [[9, 17]], "tags": ["Pinyin", "Standard-Chinese", "Traditional-Chinese"]}, {"text": "大多数学生考完了试。", "bold_text_offsets": [[3, 5]], "roman": "Dàduōshù xuéshēng kǎo wán le shì.", "bold_roman_offsets": [[9, 17]], "tags": ["Pinyin", "Standard-Chinese", "Simplified-Chinese"]}, {"text": "學生身邊帶著手機。", "bold_text_offsets": [[0, 2]], "roman": "Xuéshēng shēnbiān dài zhe shǒujī.", "bold_roman_offsets": [[0, 8]], "tags": ["Pinyin", "Standard-Chinese", "Traditional-Chinese"]}, {"text": "学生身边带着手机。", "bold_text_offsets": [[0, 2]], "roman": "Xuéshēng shēnbiān dài zhe shǒujī.", "bold_roman_offsets": [[0, 8]], "tags": ["Pinyin", "Standard-Chinese", "Simplified-Chinese"]}, {"text": "請你們選出幾位學生代表來參加。", "bold_text_offsets": [[7, 9]], "roman": "Qǐng nǐmen xuǎnchū jǐ wèi xuéshēng dàibiǎo lái cānjiā.", "bold_roman_offsets": [[26, 34]], "tags": ["Pinyin", "Standard-Chinese", "Traditional-Chinese"]}, {"text": "请你们选出几位学生代表来参加。", "bold_text_offsets": [[7, 9]], "roman": "Qǐng nǐmen xuǎnchū jǐ wèi xuéshēng dàibiǎo lái cānjiā.", "bold_roman_offsets": [[26, 34]], "tags": ["Pinyin", "Standard-Chinese", "Simplified-Chinese"]}, {"text": "大致是書院剛成立不久，學生們即愛議論時政，臧否人物。", "bold_text_offsets": [[11, 13]], "roman": "Dàzhì shì shūyuàn gāng chénglì bùjiǔ, xuéshēng men jí ài yìlùn shízhèng, zāngpǐ rénwù.", "bold_roman_offsets": [[38, 46]], "ref": "1961年8月16日，吳玉章《從甲午戰爭前後到辛亥革命前後的回憶》一", "tags": ["Pinyin", "Standard-Chinese", "Traditional-Chinese"]}, {"text": "大致是书院刚成立不久，学生们即爱议论时政，臧否人物。", "bold_text_offsets": [[11, 13]], "roman": "Dàzhì shì shūyuàn gāng chénglì bùjiǔ, xuéshēng men jí ài yìlùn shízhèng, zāngpǐ rénwù.", "bold_roman_offsets": [[38, 46]], "ref": "1961年8月16日，吳玉章《從甲午戰爭前後到辛亥革命前後的回憶》一", "tags": ["Pinyin", "Standard-Chinese", "Simplified-Chinese"]}], "classifiers": [{"classifier": "位", "tags": ["Mandarin"]}]}, {"glosses": ["師長對修業學藝者的稱呼或自稱"], "categories": ["分類詞為「位」的漢語名詞", "有引文的官話詞"], "examples": [{"text": "帝國主義的侵略打破了中國人學西方的迷夢。很奇怪，為什麼先生老是侵略學生呢？", "bold_text_offsets": [[33, 35]], "roman": "Dìguózhǔyì de qīnlüè dǎpò le Zhōngguórén xué xīfāng de mímèng. Hěn qíguài, wèishénme xiānshēng lǎoshì qīnlüè xuéshēng ne?", "bold_roman_offsets": [[109, 117]], "ref": "1949年，毛澤東《論人民民主專政》", "tags": ["Pinyin", "Standard-Chinese", "Traditional-Chinese"]}, {"text": "帝国主义的侵略打破了中国人学西方的迷梦。很奇怪，为什么先生老是侵略学生呢？", "bold_text_offsets": [[33, 35]], "roman": "Dìguózhǔyì de qīnlüè dǎpò le Zhōngguórén xué xīfāng de mímèng. Hěn qíguài, wèishénme xiānshēng lǎoshì qīnlüè xuéshēng ne?", "bold_roman_offsets": [[109, 117]], "ref": "1949年，毛澤東《論人民民主專政》", "tags": ["Pinyin", "Standard-Chinese", "Simplified-Chinese"]}], "classifiers": [{"classifier": "位", "tags": ["Mandarin"]}]}, {"glosses": ["晚輩"], "categories": ["有引文的文言文詞"], "examples": [{"text": "宰相王溥父祚，少為太原掾屬、宿州防禦使。既老，溥勸其退居洛陽。居常怏怏。及溥為相，客或候祚，溥常朝服侍立，客不安席，求去，祚曰：「學生勞賢者起避耶！」", "bold_text_offsets": [[65, 67]], "roman": "Zǎixiàng Wáng Pǔ fù Zuò, shào wéi Tàiyuán yuànshǔ, Sùzhōu fángyùshǐ. Jì lǎo, Pǔ quàn qí tuìjū Luòyáng. Jūcháng yàngyàng. Jí Pǔ wéi xiàng, kè huò hòu Zuò, Pǔ cháng cháofú shìlì, kè bù ānxí, qiú qù, Zuò yuē: “Xuéshēng láo xiánzhě qǐ bì yé!”", "bold_roman_offsets": [[207, 215]], "ref": "宋·王闢之《澠水燕談錄·名臣》", "tags": ["Pinyin", "Classical-Chinese", "Traditional-Chinese"]}, {"text": "宰相王溥父祚，少为太原掾属、宿州防御使。既老，溥劝其退居洛阳。居常怏怏。及溥为相，客或候祚，溥常朝服侍立，客不安席，求去，祚曰：「学生劳贤者起避耶！」", "bold_text_offsets": [[65, 67]], "roman": "Zǎixiàng Wáng Pǔ fù Zuò, shào wéi Tàiyuán yuànshǔ, Sùzhōu fángyùshǐ. Jì lǎo, Pǔ quàn qí tuìjū Luòyáng. Jūcháng yàngyàng. Jí Pǔ wéi xiàng, kè huò hòu Zuò, Pǔ cháng cháofú shìlì, kè bù ānxí, qiú qù, Zuò yuē: “Xuéshēng láo xiánzhě qǐ bì yé!”", "bold_roman_offsets": [[207, 215]], "ref": "宋·王闢之《澠水燕談錄·名臣》", "tags": ["Pinyin", "Classical-Chinese", "Simplified-Chinese"]}]}, {"glosses": ["讀書人或從事官職者自稱"], "categories": ["有引文的官話詞"], "examples": [{"text": "個個是學生提拔，如今皆成大僚了。", "bold_text_offsets": [[3, 5]], "roman": "Gègè shì xuéshēng tíbá, rújīn jiē chéng dàliáo le.", "bold_roman_offsets": [[9, 17]], "ref": "清·孔尚任《桃花扇·媚座》", "tags": ["Pinyin", "Written-vernacular-Chinese", "Traditional-Chinese"]}, {"text": "个个是学生提拔，如今皆成大僚了。", "bold_text_offsets": [[3, 5]], "roman": "Gègè shì xuéshēng tíbá, rújīn jiē chéng dàliáo le.", "bold_roman_offsets": [[9, 17]], "ref": "清·孔尚任《桃花扇·媚座》", "tags": ["Pinyin", "Written-vernacular-Chinese", "Simplified-Chinese"]}, {"text": "學生祖上原系世代武職，故遺下此劍。今學生已經三代改習文學，此劍並無甚用。", "bold_text_offsets": [[0, 2], [18, 20]], "roman": "Xuéshēng zǔshàng yuán xì shìdài wǔzhí, gù yíxià cǐ jiàn. Jīn xuéshēng yǐjīng sāndài gǎi xí wénxué, cǐ jiàn bìngwú shèn yòng.", "bold_roman_offsets": [[0, 8], [61, 69]], "ref": "《說岳全傳》第十回", "tags": ["Pinyin", "Written-vernacular-Chinese", "Traditional-Chinese"]}, {"text": "学生祖上原系世代武职，故遗下此剑。今学生已经三代改习文学，此剑并无甚用。", "bold_text_offsets": [[0, 2], [18, 20]], "roman": "Xuéshēng zǔshàng yuán xì shìdài wǔzhí, gù yíxià cǐ jiàn. Jīn xuéshēng yǐjīng sāndài gǎi xí wénxué, cǐ jiàn bìngwú shèn yòng.", "bold_roman_offsets": [[0, 8], [61, 69]], "ref": "《說岳全傳》第十回", "tags": ["Pinyin", "Written-vernacular-Chinese", "Simplified-Chinese"]}]}, {"glosses": ["男孩子"], "tags": ["dialectal"], "categories": ["漢語方言用語"]}], "forms": [{"form": "学生", "tags": ["Simplified-Chinese"]}], "sounds": [{"zh_pron": "xuéshēng", "tags": ["Mandarin", "Standard-Chinese", "Pinyin"]}, {"zh_pron": "ㄒㄩㄝˊ ㄕㄥ", "tags": ["Mandarin", "Standard-Chinese", "Bopomofo"]}, {"audio": "zh-xuésheng.ogg", "ogg_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/zh-xuésheng.ogg", "mp3_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/12/Zh-xuésheng.ogg/Zh-xuésheng.ogg.mp3", "tags": ["Mandarin", "Standard-Chinese"]}, {"zh_pron": "xüo² sen¹", "tags": ["Mandarin", "Chengdu", "Sichuanese", "Pinyin"]}, {"zh_pron": "щүәсын (xyəsɨn, I-II)", "tags": ["M